1ahn|n|A minute portion of time; a point of time; an instant; as, at thet very moment. ; Impulsive power; force; momentum. ; Importance, as in influence or effect; consequence; weight or value; consideration. ; An essential element; a deciding point, fact, or consideration; an essential or influential circumstance. ; An infinitesimal change in a varying quantity; an increment or decrement. ; Tendency, or measure of tendency, to produce motion, esp. motion about a fixed point or axis.	a:20z6,122,15;1e7v,112,3;ppz,77,1;5sq,55,5;97b,50,5;pwf,38,5;1lc1,36,5;ha1,31,11;1kid,26,9;15bd,25,9~20z6,122,15;ha1,31,11;1kid,26,9;15bd,25,9;1gnj,23,6;5sq,55,5;7c0,15,5;1lc1,36,5;pwf,38,5;97b,50,5	v:27xu,65,1;uun,19,4;20za,10,3~uun,19,4;20za,10,3;27xu,65,1	n:27xu,81,3~27xu,81,3
