1ahy|n|The quantity of motion in a moving body, being always proportioned to the quantity of matter multiplied into the velocity; impetus. ; Essential element, or constituent element.	a:34v,129,4;1w1v,19,6~1w1v,19,6;34v,129,4	v:twt,68,3~twt,68,3	V:vb8,45,3~vb8,45,3
